---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro'
---

<Site
  title="About SEQ Campers"
  description="SEQ Campers - Shane and Maud's Sunshine Coast off-road camper business. The story so far: from Shane walking through the door in 2013 to the new Marcoola showroom in 2025. Authorised Kimberley Campers and Stockman Products dealer."
>
  <div class="page-header page-header-tight">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>The Sunshine Coast's home for off-road caravans.</h1>
      <p>Over a decade matching adventurers to the right rig - from first-timers to seasoned grey nomads.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Intro narrative -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:780px;">
      <div style="color:var(--ink); line-height:1.8; font-size:1.05rem;">
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">
          Born from a genuine love of the open road and the great Australian outdoors, SEQ Campers has been the Sunshine Coast's go-to destination for off-road caravans and campers for over a decade. Founded by a passionate traveller who knows firsthand what it takes to explore this incredible country, we've built our reputation on honest advice, deep product knowledge and the kind of personalised service that keeps our customers coming back - and sending their mates our way.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">
          We're proud authorised specialists in <strong>Kimberley Campers</strong> and <strong>Stockman Products</strong>, and we carry a carefully curated range of new and used off-road caravans and campers to suit every adventure style and budget.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom:18px;">
          Whether you're a first-timer trying to figure out where to start, or a seasoned grey nomad chasing your next upgrade, you'll find a team here that genuinely loves this stuff as much as you do.
        </p>
        <p>
          Come in, have a chat, and let's get you out there - the Sunshine Coast is a great place to start dreaming, and we're here to help make it happen.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Meet the team -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sand-deep); padding-top:48px; padding-bottom:48px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div style="text-align:center; max-width:640px; margin:0 auto 32px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Meet the team</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px;">Shane and Maud</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--muted); margin-top:8px;">
          The team behind SEQ Campers since 2019.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="team-grid">
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/2A1608/F4EDE0/png?text=Shane%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Shane - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Shane</div>
            <div class="team-role">Owner · SEQ Campers since 2013</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Shane has called SEQ Campers home since 2013 and has been the proud owner since 2019. Deep love of the outdoors, hands-on mechanical background. He connects with customers as a fellow adventurer who knows exactly what you need out on the road.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="team-card">
          <div class="team-photo">
            <img
              src="https://placehold.co/600x600/C0341A/F4EDE0/png?text=Maud%0A%28Photo+coming%29&font=montserrat"
              alt="Maud - placeholder portrait"
              loading="lazy"
            />
          </div>
          <figcaption class="team-meta">
            <div class="team-name">Maud</div>
            <div class="team-role">Co-owner · Customer Care · Operations</div>
            <p class="team-bio">
              Maud joined Shane in running the business in 2019, bringing a sharp business mind and a passion for ethical, people-first service. She makes sure every customer feels like part of the SEQ Campers family.
            </p>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Four chapters timeline -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header" style="justify-content:center; text-align:center; flex-direction:column; gap:4px; margin-bottom:24px;">
        <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Our path here</div>
        <h2 class="section-title">Four chapters, one passion.</h2>
      </div>

      <ol class="story-timeline" aria-label="Company history">
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2013</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Shane walks through the door</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Started as a staff member with a love of the outdoors and an eye for a good rig. Turns out, it was the beginning of something bigger than just a job.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2019</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">Shane &amp; Maud take the wheel</h3>
          <p class="story-body">Shane purchased SEQ Campers and alongside Maud, wasted no time making it their own - moving to a new location, building out the team and launching the SEQ Campers YouTube channel all in the same year. Same great business, fresh energy, and a whole new chapter underway.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2020-2021</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">COVID couldn't stop us</h3>
          <p class="story-body">When the showroom doors had to close, the cameras stayed rolling. What started as a way to keep connected with customers turned into a real community - and the YouTube channel now boasts 2,000+ subscribers and counting.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="story-step">
          <div class="story-year">2025</div>
          <h3 class="story-title">New home, new website, still going strong</h3>
          <p class="story-body">We packed up and moved to our best location yet - Marcoola, just minutes from the Sunshine Coast Airport and a stone's throw from one of the coast's most beautiful beach towns. We've also just launched this brand spanking new website to match. Easy to find whether you're local or travelling from further afield - and yes, the site looks just as good as the rigs. Come see us.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why buy from us - three differentiators -->
  <section class="section" style="background:var(--sand-deep);">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:980px;">
      <div class="page-eyebrow" style="color:var(--rust);">Why buy from us</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" style="margin-top:6px; margin-bottom:28px;">What you get from us</h2>
      <div class="services-grid">
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Shane doesn't sell what he hasn't used</h3>
          <p>Every model on the floor has been tested, walked through, and inspected. If we wouldn't take it out, you won't see it on the lot.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>Buy and service in one place</h3>
          <p>The workshop that preps your van is the same one that services it for the next 20 years.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="service-card">
          <h3>No rush to close</h3>
          <p>We're not in a hurry to close a sale. We're in a hurry to make sure you walk out with the right van.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band-dark" style="margin-top:0;">
    <div class="container" style="text-align:center; max-width:680px; margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="color:var(--sand); font-size:1.6rem; margin-bottom:12px;">Come and see us in Marcoola.</h2>
      <p style="color:var(--gold); margin-bottom:24px;">
        Showroom appointments preferred, after-hours always welcome.
      </p>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:12px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
        <a href="/reserve" class="btn-primary">Reserve your slot →</a>
        <a href="/stock" class="btn-ghost">Browse used stock</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
